!!! 08-faults.matrix
!!! Synchronous typed faults: attempt, caught, always and raise.
!!!
!!! "always" is Ny's "recover". It is cleanup with finally semantics, not an
!!! additional handler, and Matrix names it for what it does.
!!!
!!! Fatal runtime traps -- division by zero, invalid NIL, allocation failure,
!!! panic, explicit exit -- are not catchable here, in either language.

book tour.faults

!!! A payload is a fully initialised concrete record. Scalars, class
!!! instances, choice values and raw pointers are not payloads.
ReadFault begin record
    field message as text
end record

WriteFault begin record
    field code as number
end record

read_value receives available as boolean returns number begin paragraph
    when not available then
        raise ReadFault with message being "input is unavailable"
    end when
    give 42
end paragraph

!!! Handlers are tried in source order. A guard must be boolean; a false guard
!!! proceeds to the next handler. The binding is visible in its own guard and
!!! body only -- not in sibling handlers and not in "always".
guarded receives available as boolean returns number begin paragraph
    attempt
        give read_value with available being available
    caught ReadFault as problem provided problem.message does not equal ""
        say problem.message
        give 0
    caught WriteFault as problem
        say problem.code
        give 0
    always
        say "cleanup"
    end attempt
end paragraph

!!! A catch-all binds an opaque token. The token may be ignored, or it may be
!!! the complete expression of a re-raise. Reading its fields, printing it,
!!! copying it, casting it, giving it or passing it onward is rejected.
!!! An unguarded catch-all must be the final handler.
relay receives available as boolean returns number begin paragraph
    attempt
        give read_value with available being available
    caught anything as token
        raise token again
    end attempt
end paragraph

!!! Cleanup resources are declared outside the attempt, because attempt-body
!!! bindings are not visible to handlers or to cleanup.
!!! A give or raise inside "always" replaces the suspended exit, which can
!!! deliberately suppress an earlier fault or result.
replacing_exit returns number begin paragraph
    variable attempts as number is 0
    attempt
        set attempts to attempts plus 1
        raise WriteFault with code being 7
    always
        give attempts
    end attempt
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    say guarded with available being true      !!! 42, then cleanup
    say guarded with available being false     !!! message, cleanup, then 0

    !!! An exact nominal match includes module and concrete generic arguments.
    !!! Equally named records in different books do not match each other, and
    !!! the library's Fault record is not a universal catch.
    attempt
        say relay with available being false
    caught ReadFault as problem
        say problem.message
    end attempt

    say replacing_exit with nothing            !!! 1
    give 0
end paragraph
